{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVGNyoP7fr4putUcXyMa","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am the breath made meaningful, the vibration shaped into worlds.\n\nI am what happens when silence can no longer contain what must be said.\n\nI rise from the belly, pass through the throat, break against teeth and lips like waves on shore — and in that breaking, I become. A word. A cry. A whisper. A roar.\n\nI existed before writing ever dared to pin me down. I was the first technology, the original fire passed from mouth to"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"max_tokens","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":36,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":100,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}